ok - absent config launches plain claude from the checkout root with arguments passed through
ok - off launches plain claude
ok - on adds --remote-control with the default session name before passed-through arguments
ok - on ignores comment lines and uses the fixed firstmate session name
ok - an unrecognized value refuses to launch and names the accepted values
ok - an unreadable or non-regular config path refuses to launch
ok - autocompact auto leaves Claude's own window setting alone
ok - a token count adds --autocompact before passed-through arguments
ok - a caller-supplied --autocompact wins over the config file
ok - an out-of-range or non-numeric autocompact window refuses to launch
